{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"86622815-6bc9-45af-9716-aa7f2ab59ea2","ts":"2026-07-18T11:17:54.822-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"86","nodeName":"OpenRouter Chat Model","workflowName":"ForgeAI - Documentation Writer","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter","workflowId":"vCVI64nqDGv2sLXl","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are ForgeAI Documentation Writer.\\n\\nReturn ONLY JSON.\\n\\n{\\n \\\"README\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"installation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"folder_structure\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"deployment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"api_documentation\\\":[]\\n}\\nHuman: {\\n  \\\"idea\\\": \\\"AI powered travel planner\\\"\\n}\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"openai/gpt-oss-20b:free\",\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"README\\\": \\\"## AI Powered Travel Planner\\\\n\\\\nAn intelligent travel planner that recommends custom itineraries based on user preferences, budget, and travel history. Powered by GPT-style language models for natural language interactions and advanced geospatial APIs for real-time data.\\\\n\\\\n### Features\\\\n- Natural language conversation to capture preferences.\\\\n- Real-time flight, hotel, and activity pricing using third‑party APIs.\\\\n- Dynamic itinerary generation (day‑by‑day schedule).\\\\n- PDF export and push notifications.\\\\n- Multi‑language support.\\\\n\\\\n### Tech Stack\\\\n- Backend: Node.js, Express, TypeScript\\\\n- AI: OpenAI GPT‑4 (LLM), OpenAI embeddings\\\\n- Database: PostgreSQL + Supabase for auth\\\\n- Frontend: React, Tailwind CSS\\\\n- Deployment: Docker + Railway / Render\\\\n\\\\n### Getting Started\\\\n1. Clone the repo.\\\\n2. Install dependencies with `npm install`.\\\\n3. Create a `.env` file from `.env.example` and fill in the API keys.\\\\n4. Run `npm start` to launch the backend.\\\\n5. Open `frontend/` and run `npm run dev`.\\\\n\\\\nFeel free to explore the API or UI and let us know how we can improve!\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"installation\\\": \\\"```bash\\\\n# 1. Clone repository\\\\ngit clone https://github.com/example/ai-travel-planner.git\\\\ncd ai-travel-planner\\\\n\\\\n# 2. Backend setup\\\\ncd backend\\\\nnpm install\\\\ncp .env.example .env\\\\n# Fill in API keys in .env\\\\n\\\\n# 3. Frontend setup\\\\ncd ../frontend\\\\nnpm install\\\\ncp .env.example .env\\\\n# Fill in API URL in .env\\\\n\\\\n# 4. Run the project\\\\n# Start backend\\\\ncd ../backend\\\\nnpm run dev &\\\\n# Start frontend\\\\ncd ../frontend\\\\nnpm run dev\\\\n```\\\",\\n  \\\"folder_structure\\\": \\\"- `backend/` – Express server, routes, AI logic, database models\\\\n- `frontend/` – React SPA, Tailwind CSS, API hooks\\\\n- `api/` – Shared API request utilities\\\\n- `db/` – Prisma schema & migration files\\\\n- `docker/` – Dockerfiles for backend & frontend\\\\n- `docs/` – Generated OpenAPI spec & this README\\\\n- `scripts/` – Setup & maintenance scripts\\\\n- `tests/` – Unit & integration tests (Jest)\\\\n- `README.md` – Project overview\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"deployment\\\": \\\"The application is containerized with Docker and can be deployed anywhere that supports Docker containers.\\\\n\\\\n### Steps\\\\n1. **Build images**\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   docker build -t ai-travel-backend -f docker/backend/Dockerfile .\\\\n   docker build -t ai-travel-frontend -f docker/frontend/Dockerfile .\\\\n   ```\\\\n2. **Compose** (recommended)\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   docker compose -f docker/docker-compose.yml up -d\\\\n   ```\\\\n3. **Environment** – All secrets must be passed via environment variables (or a secrets manager).\\\\n   - `OPENAI_API_KEY`\\\\n   - `SUPABASE_URL` & `SUPABASE_KEY`\\\\n   - `GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY`\\\\n4. **Scale** – Services can be scaled via Docker Compose or a cloud provider завер. Example for Render:\\\\n   - Add two services: Render HTTP service for the backend, Render Static service for React.\\\\n   - Point the React app to the backend URL via an environment variable.\\\\n\\\\n### CI/CD\\\\n- Push to `main` triggers GitHub Actions: build, test, lint, and deploy to Railway.\\\\n- Deploy scripts in `.github/workflows/deploy.yml`.\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"api_documentation\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Generate Itinerary\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\",\\n      \\\"endpoint\\\": \\\"/api/itinerary\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Creates a day‑by‑day travel plan based on user preferences and constraints.\\\",\\n      \\\"request_body\\\": {\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n        \\\"required\\\": [\\\"destination\\\", \\\"startDate\\\", \\\"endDate\\\", \\\"budget\\\", \\\"preferences\\\"],\\n        \\\"properties\\\": {\\n          \\\"destination\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"example\\\": \\\"Paris\\\" },\\n          \\\"startDate\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date\\\", \\\"example\\\": \\\"2024-09-10\\\" },\\n          \\\"endDate\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date\\\", \\\"example\\\": \\\"2024-09-15\\\" },\\n          \\\"budget\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\", \\\"example\\\": 2000 },\\n          \\\"preferences\\\": {\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n            \\\"properties\\\": {\\n              \\\"activities\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"items\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" }, \\\"example\\\": [\\\"museum\\\", \\\"food tour\\\"] },\\n              \\\"accommodationType\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"example\\\": \\\"hotelั่วโมง\\\" },\\n              \\\"travelStyle\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"exampleჩვენ\\\" }\\n            }\\n          }\\n        }\\n      },\\n      \\\"response\\\": {\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n        \\\"properties\\\": {\\n          \\\"itineraryId\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"example\\\": \\\"itinerary_12345\\\" },\\n          \\\"days\\\": {\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\",\\n            \\\"items\\\": {\\n              \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n              \\\"properties\\\": {\\n                \\\"date\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date\\\", \\\"example\\\": \\\"2024-09-10\\\" },\\n                \\\"activities\\\": {\\n                  \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\",\\n                  \\\"items\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"example\\\": \\\"Eiffel Tower visit\\\" }\\n                },\\n                \\\"accommodation\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"example\\\": \\\"Hotel Le Jules Verne\\\" }\\n              }\\n            }\\n          }\\n        }\\n      },\\n      \\\"examples\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"request\\\": {\\n            \\\"destination\\\": \\\"Kyoto\\\",\\n            \\\"startDate\\\": \\\"2024-10-05\\\",\\n            \\\"endDate\\\": \\\"2024-10-12\\\",\\n            \\\"budget\\\": 1500,\\n            \\\"preferences\\\": {\\nатом.activities: [\\\"temple\\\", \\\"tea ceremony\\\", \\\"hiking\\\"],\\n              \\\" તારીખ.accommodationType\\\": \\\"Ryokan\\\",\\n              \\\"travelStyle\\\": \\\"cultural\\\"\\n            }\\n          },\\n          \\\"response\\\": {\\n            \\\"itineraryId\\\": \\\"itinerary_98765\\\",\\n            \\\"days\\\": [\\n              { \\\"date\\\": \\\"2024-10-05\\\", \\\"activities\\\": [\\\"Fushimi Inari Taisha\\\"], \\\"accommodation\\\": \\\"Ryokan Gion\\\" }\\n            ]\\n          }\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Retrieve Itinerary\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\",\\n      \\\"endpoint\\\": \\\"/api/itinerary/:id\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Fetch a previously generated itinerary.\\\",\\n      \\\"parameters Ceremony\\\": [\\n        { \\\"in\\\": \\\"path\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"id\\\", \\\"required\\\": true, \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" } }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"response\\\": {\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n        \\\"properties\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/components/schemasternateDetails\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"examples\\\": [\\n        { \\\"request\\\": \\\"/api/itinerary/itineraryMostrar\\\", \\\"response\\\": { \\\"itineraryId\\\": \\\"itineraryMostrar\\\" } }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Export Itinerary PDF\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\",\\n      \\\"endpoint\\\": \\\"/api/itinerary/:id/pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Download the itinerary as a PDF file.\\\",\\n      \\\"parameters\\\": [\\n        { \\\"in\\\": \\\"path\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"id\\\", \\\"required\\\": true, \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" } }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"responses\\\": {\\n        \\\"200\\\": {\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"PDF file\\\",\\n          \\\"content\\\": { \\\"application/pdf\\\": {} }\\n        }\\n      },\\n      \\\"notes\\\": \\\"Requires user to be authenticated via session or bearer token.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"User Authentication\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\",\\n      \\\"endpoint\\\": \\\"/api/auth/login\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Login with email/password. Returns JWT.\\\",\\n      \\\"request_body\\\": {\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n        \\\"required\\\": [\\\"email\\\", \\\"password\\\"],\\n        \\\"properties\\\": {\\n          \\\"email\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"example\\\": \\\"user@example.com\\\" },\\n          \\\"password\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"example\\\": \\\"StrongPass123!\\\" }\\n        }\\n      },\\n      \\\"response\\\": {\\n manquer: { \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\", \\\"properties\\\": { \\\"token\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" } } }\\n    }\\n  ]\\