ble.\\\",\\n    \\\"Use fine‑grained OAuthсел 2.0 for API integrations, with short‑lived tokens and proper revocation.\\\",\\n    \\\"Apply strict input validation (whitelisting) and output encoding to mitigate injection and XSS attacks.\\\",\\n    \\\"Enforce multi‑factor authentication (MFA) for all user accounts and consider adaptive MFA for high‑risk actions.\\\",\\n    \\\"Conduct regular third‑party security assessments and maintain an up‑to‑date inventory of external services.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"authentication\\\": \\\"OAuth 2.0 with OpenID Connect, combined with MFA (SMS, authenticator app, or FIDO2). Passwords stored hashed with Argon2id, 32‑byte salt, 100,000 iterations.\\\",\\n  \\\"authorization\\\": \\\"Role‑based access control (RBAC) with separate scopes for reading, writing, and administrative tasks. Use JSON Web Tokens (JWT) with short lifetimes and claims for resource ownership checks.\\\",\\n  \\\"vulnerabilities\\\": [\\n    \\\"SQL injection\\\",\\n    \\\"NoSQL injection\\\",\\n    \\\"Crossန-site scripting (XSS)\\\",\\n    \\\"Cross‑site request forgery (CSRF)\\\",\\n    \\\"Insecure direct object references (IDOR)\\\",\\n    \\\"Insufficient logging and monitoring\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":590,\"promptTokens\":126,\"totalTokens\":716}}}"}}
