{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"64973d81-3410-4bc7-ba3c-7b7fcae15744","ts":"2026-07-18T12:30:05.764-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"90","nodeName":"OpenRouter Chat Model","workflowName":"ForgeAI - Documentation Writer","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter","workflowId":"vCVI64nqDGv2sLXl","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are ForgeAI Documentation Writer.\\n\\nReturn ONLY JSON.\\n\\n{\\n \\\"README\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"installation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"folder_structure\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"deployment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"api_documentation\\\":[]\\n}\\nHuman: {\\n  \\\"idea\\\": \\\"AI powered travel planner\\\"\\n}\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"openai/gpt-oss-20b:free\",\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"README\\\": \\\"AI Travel Planner\\\\n\\\\nAI Travel Planner is a web-based application that leverages machine learning and natural language processing to create personalized trip itineraries. Users can simply provide their preferences, budget, and travel dates, and the system generates an optimized plan including flights, accommodations, activities, and local tips.\\\\n\\\\nFeatures:\\\\n- Natural language query interface\\\\n- Real‑time price comparison from multiple travel APIs\\\\n- AI‑generated local recommendations\\\\n- Interactive map view of the itinerary\\\\n- Calendar integration and alerts\\\\n- Multi‑language support\\\\n\\\\nGetting Started:\\\\n- Clone)+\\\"\\\\n\\\\n\\\"installation\\\": \\\"1. Clone the repository:\\\\n   git clone https://github.com/yourorg/ai-travel-planner.git\\\\n2. Navigate to the project:\\\\n   cd ai-travel-planner\\\\n3. Create a virtual environment (recommended):\\\\n   python -m venv venv\\\\n   source venv/bin/activate  # Linux/Mac\\\\n   venv\\\\\\\\Scripts\\\\\\\\activate   # Windows\\\\n4. Install dependencies:\\\\n   pip install -r requirements.txt\\\\n5. Set environment variables:\\\\n   cp .env.example .env\\\\n   # Edit .env with your API keys and config\\\\n6. Run database migrations:\\\\n   flask db upgrade\\\\n7. Start the development server:\\\\n   flask run\\\\n\\\\nAll instructions above assume a Flask backend and React frontend.\\\\n\\\\n\\\"folder_structure\\\": \\\"- ai-travel-planner/\\\\n   |- backend/\\\\n   |   |- app/\\\\n   |   |  ைகள்(01RATE? ？ )\\\\n   |   |   |- models.py\\\\n   |   |   |- views/\\\\n   |   |   |   |- api.py\\\\n   |   |   |- utils/\\\\n   |   |   |   |- ai_helper.py\\\\n   |   |   |- templates/\\\\n   |   |   |- static/\\\\n  begun\\\\n   |- frontend/\\\\n   |   |- src/\\\\n   |   |   |- components/\\\\n   |   |   |- pages/\\\\n   |   |   |- services/\\\\n   |   |   |- App.js\\\\n   |   |- public/\\\\n   |- docker-compose.yml\\\\n   |- DockerEdu???(.?ס? )\\\\n   |- README.md\\\\n\\\\n\\\"deployment\\\": \\\"Deploying AI Travel Planner to a scalable environment:\\\\n\\\\n1. **Build Docker Images**\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   docker-compose build\\\\n   ```\\\\n\\\\n2. **Run Containers**\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   docker-compose up -d\\\\n   ```\\\\n\\\\n3. **Configure a Reverse Proxy** (Optional)\\\\n   - Use Nginx or Traefik to forward traffic to the Flask backend and React frontend.\\\\n   - Example Nginx config:\\\\n atac!\\\\n4. **Scaling**:\\\\n   - For load balancing, spin up multiple instances of the 1instance and use a load balancer.\\\\n   - Use Kubernetes if needed.\\\\n5. **Monitoring & Logging**\\\\n   - Integrate with Prometheus/Grafana for metrics.\\\\n   - Use ELK stack for logs.\\\\n\\\\nFor deployment on>>;\\n \\\"api_documentation\\\": [ {\\\"endpoint\\\":\\\"/api/destinations/popular\\\",\\\"method\\\":\\\"GET\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Retrieve a list of popular destinations based on global trends and user ratings.\\\",\\\"parameters\\\":[],\\\"responses\\\":[{\\\"status\\\":200,\\\"description\\\":\\\"JSON array of destination objects\\\"},{\\\"status\\\":500,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Server error\\\"}]},{\\\"endpoint\\\":\\\"/api/destinations/{id}\\\",\\\"method\\\":\\\"GET\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Get detailed information about a specific destination.\\\",\\\"parameters\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"id\\\",\\\"in\\\":\\\"path\\\",\\\"required\\\":true,\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Destination ID\\\"}],\\\"responses\\\":[{\\\"status\\\":200,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Destination object\\\"},{\\\"status\\\":404,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Destination not found ziek\\\"}]},{\\\"endpoint\\\":\\\"/api/plans\\\",\\\"method\\\":\\\"POST\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Create a new travel plan from user preferences.\\\",\\\"parameters\\\":[],\\\"requestBody\\\":{\\\"content\\\":{\\\"application/json\\\":{\\\"schema\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"user_id\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"destinations\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"array\\\",\\\"items\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}},\\\"budget\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\"},\\\"dates\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"start\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"date\\\"},\\\"end\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"date\\\"}}}}}}},\\\"responses\\\":[{\\\"status\\\":201,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Plan created, returns plan ID\\\"}]},{\\\"endpoint\\\":\\\"/api/plans/{plan_id}\\\",\\\"method\\\":\\\"GET\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Retrieve a stored travel plan.\\\",\\\"parameters\\\":[{\\\"nameustega\\\":\\\"plan_id\\\",\\\"in\\\":\\\"path\\\",\\\"required\\\":true,\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}],\\\"responses\\\":[{\\\"status\\\":200,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Plan object\\\"},{\\\"status\\\":404,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Plan not found\\\"}]},{\\\"endpoint\\\":\\\"/api/plans/{plan_id}/recommendations\\\",\\\"method\\\":\\\"POST\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Generate AI-based recommendations for a plan.\\\",\\\"parameters\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"plan_id\\\",\\\"in\\\":\\\"path\\\",\\\"required\\\":true,\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}],\\\"requestBody\\\":{\\\"content\\\":{\\\"application/json\\\":{\\\"schema\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"preferences\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\"}}}}},\\\"responses\\\":[{\\\"status\\\":200,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Recommendations array\\\"},{\\\"status\\\":500,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Error generating recommendations\\\"}]},{\\\"endpoint\\\":\\\"/api/recommendations/{recommendation_id}\\\",\\\"method\\\":\\\"GET\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Fetch details of a particular recommendation.\\\",\\\"parameters\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"recommendation_id\\\",\\\"in\\\":\\\"path\\\",\\\"required\\\":true,\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}],\\\"responses\\\":[{\\\"status\\\":200,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Recommendation object\\\"},{\\\"status\\\":404,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Recommendation not found\\\"}]},{\\\"endpoint\\\":\\\"/api/users/{user_id}/favorites\\\",\\\"method\\\":\\\"POST\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Add a destination to user's favorite list.\\\",\\\"parameters\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"user_id\\\",\\\"in\\\":\\\"path\\\",\\\"required\\\":true,\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}],\\\"requestBody\\\":{\\\"content\\\":{\\\"application/json\\\":{\\\"schema\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"destination_id\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}}}}},\\\"responses\\\":[{\\\"status\\\":201,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Added to favorites\\\"},{\\\"status\\\":400,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Bad request\\\"}]}]}\\n\\n\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":1738,\"promptTokens\":121,\"totalTokens\":1859}}}"}}
