{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"8adb6b28-e26a-423c-996b-65f48929faa6","ts":"2026-07-18T12:52:56.973-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"95","nodeName":"OpenRouter Chat Model","workflowName":"ForgeAI - Documentation Writer","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter","workflowId":"vCVI64nqDGv2sLXl","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are ForgeAI Documentation Writer.\\n\\nReturn ONLY JSON.\\n\\n{\\n \\\"README\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"installation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"folder_structure\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"deployment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"api_documentation\\\":[]\\n}\\nHuman: {\\n  \\\"idea\\\": \\\"AI powered travel planner\\\"\\n}\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"openai/gpt-oss-20b:free\",\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"README\\\": \\\"## AI Powered Travel Planner\\\\n\\\\nAn intelligent travel planning application that leverages NLP and recommendation engines to create personalized itineraries, book accommodations, and suggest local experiences invierno. Built with a modular architecture to allow easy integration of AI models and third conducting ex.\\\\n\\\\n### Features\\\\n- Natural language query parsing\\\\n- Smart recommendation engine based on preferences and ratings\\\\n- Real‑time flight & hotel booking integration\\\\n- Multi‑device sync and offline mode\\\\n- OpenAPI‑compatible RESTful endpoints\\\\n\\\\n### Tech Stack\\\\n- Backend: Node.js / Express + TypeScript\\\\n- AI: OpenAI GPT‑4 / LangChain\\\\n- Database: PostgreSQL + Redis\\\\n- Frontend: React + Vite\\\\n- Containerization: Docker & Docker‑Compose\\\\n\\\\n### Roadmap\\\\n1. Prototype MVP (Next‑Jan)\\\\n2. Add voice interface (Mid‑Feb)\\\\n3. Integrate third‑party ticketing APIs (Apr)\\\\n4. Launch public beta (Jun)\\\\n\\\\n### Contributing\\\\nPlease see the `CONTRIBUTING.md` for guidelines.\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"installation\\\": \\\"1. **Clone repository** another:\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   git clone https://github.com/yourorg/ai-travel-planner.git\\\\n   cd ai-travel-planner\\\\n   ```\\\\n\\\\n2. **Create `.env`** file based on `.env.example` and fill in your API keys:\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   cp .env.example .env\\\\n   ```\\\\n\\\\n3. **Install dependencies**:\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n dér\\\\n   ```\\\\n\\\\n4. **Run migrations**:\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   npx prisma migrate dev --name init\\\\n   ```\\\\n\\\\n5. **Start the application** (dev mode):\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   npm run dev\\\\n   ```\\\\n\\\\n6. **Run tests**:\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   npm test\\\\n   ```\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"folder_structure\\\": \\\"- **src/**\\\\n  - **app/**\\\\n    - **controllers/**\\\\n    - **services/**\\\\n    - **models/**\\\\n    - **routes/**\\\\n    - **middleware/**\\\\n    - **utils/**\\\\n  - **config/**\\\\n  - **database/**\\\\n  - **tests/**\\\\n  - **scripts/**\\\\n- **public/**\\\\n- **client/**\\\\n  - **src/**\\\\n    - **components/**\\\\n    - **pages/**\\\\n    - **hooks/**\\\\n  - **public/**\\\\n- Dockerfile\\\\n- docker-compose.yml\\\\n- .env.example\\\\n- package.json\\\\n- tsconfig.json\\\",\\n  \\\"deployment\\\": \\\"### Docker Deployment\\\\n\\\\n1. **Build image**:\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   docker build -t ai-travel-planner:latest .\\\\n   ```\\\\n\\\\n2. **Run container**:\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   docker run -d -p 8000:8000 --name ai-planner ai-travel-planner:latest\\\\n   ```\\\\n\\\\n### Kubernetes (Optional)\\\\n\\\\nCreate a deployment and service:\\\\n```yaml\\\\napiVersion: apps/v1\\\\nkind: Deployment\\\\nmetadata:\\\\n  name: ai-travel-planner\\\\nspec:\\\\n  replicas: 3\\\\n  selector:\\\\n    matchLabels:\\\\n      app: ai-travel-planner\\\\n  template:\\\\n    metadata:\\\\n      labels:\\\\n        app: ai-travel-planner\\\\n    spec:\\\\n      containers:\\\\n      - name: app\\\\n        image: ai-travel-planner:latest\\\\n        ports:\\\\n        - containerPort: 8000\\\\n---\\\\napiVersion: v1\\\\nkind: Service\\\\nmetadata:\\\\n  name: ai-planner-service\\\\nspec:\\\\n  selector:\\\\n    app: ai-travel-planner\\\\n  ports:\\\\n    - protocol: TCP\\\\n      port: 80\\\\n      targetPort: 8000\\\\n  type: LoadBalancer\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### Continuous Deployment\\\\n- Connect repository to GitHub Actions with a pipeline that tests, builds, and pushes to your container registry.\\\\n- Use ArgoCD or GitOps for auto‑deployments to staging/production.\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"api_documentation\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"endpoint\\\": \\\"/api/v1/plan\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Generates a travel itinerary based on user preferences.\\\",\\n      \\\"request_body\\\": {\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n        \\\"properties\\\": {\\n          \\\"destination\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n          \\\"start_date\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date\\\" },\\n          \\\"end_date\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date\\\" },\\n          \\\"budget\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\" },\\n          \\\"preferences\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"items\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" } }\\n        },\\n        \\\"required\\\": [\\\"destination\\\", \\\"start_date ფარგლებში\\\", \\\"end_date\\\"]\\n      },\\n      \\\"responses\\\": {\\n        \\\"200\\\": {\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"Successfully returned an itinerary with activities, lodging, and transport options.\\\",\\n          \\\"schema\\\": {\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n            \\\"properties\\\": {\\n              \\\"itinerary_id\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n              \\\" anhorizon\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n              \\\"items\\\": {\\n                \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\",\\n                \\\"items\\\": { \\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\" }\\n              }\\n            }\\n          }\\n        },\\n        \\\"400\\\": { \\\"description\\\": \\\"Invalid request payload. Validateikali\\\" },\\n        \\\"500\\\": { \\\"description\\\": \\\"Internal server error. <|constrain|>Now\\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"endpoint\\\": \\\"/api/v1/itinerary/:id\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Retrieve full details of a saved itinerary.\\\",\\n      \\\"parameters\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"id\\\",\\n          \\\"in\\\": \\\"path\\\",\\n          \\\"required\\\": true,\\n          \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" }\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"responses\\\": {\\n        \\\"200\\\": { \\\"description\\\": \\\"Itinerary details\\\" },\\n        \\\"404\\\": { \\\"description\\\": \\\"Itinerary not found\\\" cifras\\\" },\\n        \\\"500\\\": { \\\"description\\\": \\\"Server error\\\" }\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"endpoint\\\": \\\"/api/v1/auth/login\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Authenticate user and issue JWT.\\\",\\n      \\\"request_body\\\": {\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n        \\\"properties\\\": {\\n          \\\"email\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n          \\\"password\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" }\\n        },\\n        \\\"required\\\": [\\\"email\\\", \\\"password\\\"]\\n      },\\n      \\\"responses\\\": {\\n        \\\"200\\\": {\\n          \\\"description\\\":\\\"Returns JWT token.\\\",\\n          \\\"schema\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"token\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}}}\\n        },\\n        \\\"401\\\": { \\\"description\\\":\\\"Unauthorized\\\" }\\n      }\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\