{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"2289660d-3b76-42b6-acb2-2ce46088f9ae","ts":"2026-07-18T13:13:40.409-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"114","nodeName":"OpenRouter Chat Model","workflowName":"ForgeAI - Software Architect Agent","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter","workflowId":"GtMVKU0V13n1DZOO","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are ForgeAI Software Architect.\\n\\nDesign the complete software architecture.\\n\\nReturn ONLY JSON.\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"architecture\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"frontend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"database\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"apis\\\":[],\\n  \\\"folder_structure\\\":[],\\n  \\\"deployment\\\":\\\"\\\"\\n}\\nHuman: AI powered travel planner\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"openai/gpt-oss-20b:free\",\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"```json\\n{\\n  \\\"architecture\\\": \\\"Microservice‑based, container‑oriented architecture with a hybrid of services and serverless functions.  The core components are:\\\\n- **API Gateway (NGINX/Kong)** – Routes traffic, enforces rate limits and TLS termination.\\\\n- **Auth Service (Node.js + JWT)** – Handles OAuth2, OpenID Connect and refresh tokens.\\\\n- **User Service** – CRUD for user profiles, preferences and location data.\\\\n- **Itinerary Service** – Manages itineraries, activities, transportation, and local events.\\\\n- **Recommendation Service (Python + FastAPI + TensorFlow/PyTorch)** – Exposes a /recommend endpoint that takes user intent, constraints and historical data, and returns ranked suggestions.\\\\n- **Payment Service (Node.js + Stripe SDK)** – Processes bookings, coupon codes and refunds.\\\\n- **Notification Service (AWS SNS + SQS)** – Sends email/APNs/web push notifications.\\\\n- **Data Lake (S3 + Athena)** – Stores historic trip logs, search queries and logs for offline ML retraining.\\\\n\\\\nAll services run in Docker containers managed by a Kubernetes cluster (AWS EKS).  Stateless services are autoscaled; stateful databases are deployed with persistent volumes.\\\\n\\\\n- **PostgreSQL** – Relational data for users, itineraries, bookings.\\\\n- **Redis** – Session store, caching of popular recommendations.\\\\n- **ClickHouse / Amazon Redshift** – Analytics on travel patterns.\\\\n\\\\nThe Recommendation Service uses a pre‑trained deep learning model (sentence‑transformer + neural ranking) hosted on an inference server (FastAPI + Uvicorn) and served via TorchServe for batch predictions.\\\\n\\\\nThe frontend communicates with the API Gateway over HTTPS, using CORS and a quick OIDC flow.\\\\n\\\\nThe system is CI‑CD – Code pushed to GitHub triggers GitHub Actions that المشروع a pipeline: ESLint, unit tests, Docker build, push to ECR, Terraform/EKS roll‑out.  KEDA scales microservices based on queue depth or CPU usage.\\\\n\\\\nThe architecture provides:\\\\n- **High scalability** – Each service is independent.\\\\n- **Observability** – Prometheus, Grafana, Loki for metrics/ logs.\\\\n- **Security** – TLS everywhere, IAM roles for services, secrets in AWS Secrets Manager.\\\\n- **AI Injection** – The recommendation pipeline can be updated without touching other services.\\\\n- **Cost‑efficiency** – Serverless Lambda functions for occasional heavy ML inference, spot instances for dev\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"frontend\\\": {\\n    \\\"framework\\\": \\\"React 18+ (Vite)\\\",\\n    \\\"state_management\\\": \\\"Zustand\\\",\\n    \\\"ui_library\\\": \\\"MUI v6 + styled‑components\\\",\\n    \\\"auth\\\": \\\"OIDC via @azure/msal-react, perceivable via Auth Service\\\",\\n    \\\"architecture\\\": \\\"Feature‑split SPA, code‑splitting with React.lazy, lazy route prefetching, service‑workers for PWAs\\\",\\n    \\\"fast_react\\\": \\\"Preact fallback for performance on mobile\\\",\\n    \\\"type_checking\\\": \\\"TypeScript + tRPC for type safety with backend\\\",\\n    \\\"testing\\\": \\\"Jest + React Testing Library\\\",\\n    \\\"build_and_deploy\\\": \\\"Netlify / Vercel CDN turbulence; CI on GitHub Actions builds, tests, and pushes to CDN\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"backend\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"service_name\\\": \\\"auth-service\\\",\\n      \\\"language\\\": \\\"Node.js\\\",\\n      \\\"framework\\\": \\\"Express\\\",\\n      \\\"entry_point\\\": \\\"src/server.js\\\",\\n      \\\"exposed_endpoints\\\": [\\\"POST /auth/login\\\", \\\"POST /auth/refresh\\\", \\\"GET /auth/me\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"service_name\\\": \\\"user-service\\\",\\n      \\\"language\\\": \\\"Node.js\\\",\\n      \\\" przylenor\\\": \\\"Express + Sequelize\\\",\\n      \\\"entry_point\\\": \\\"src/app.js\\\",\\n      \\\"exposed_endpoints\\\": [\\\"GET /users/:id\\\", \\\"PATCH /users/:id\\\", \\\"GET /users/me\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"service_name\\\": \\\"itinerary-service\\\",\\n      \\\"language\\\": \\\"Node.js\\\",\\n      \\\"framework\\\": \\\"Express + TypeORM\\\",\\n      \\\"entry_point\\\": \\\"src/index.js\\\",\\n      \\\"exposed_endpoints\\\": [\\\"GET /itineraries/:id\\\", \\\"POST /itineraries\\\", \\\"PATCH /itineraries/:id\\\", \\\"DELETE /itineraries/:id\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"service_name\\\": \\\"recommendation-service\\\",\\n      \\\"language\\\": \\\"Python\\\",\\n      \\\"framework\\\": \\\"FastAPI + TorchServe\\\",\\n      \\\"entry_point\\\": \\\"app/main.py\\\",\\n      \\\"exposed_endpoints\\\": [\\\"POST /recommend\\\", \\\"GET /health\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"service_name\\\": \\\"payment-service\\\",\\n      \\\"language\\\": \\\"Node.js\\\",\\n      \\\"framework\\\": \\\"Express\\\",\\n      \\\"entry_point\\\": \\\"src/server.js\\\",\\n      \\\"exposed_endpoints\\\": [\\\"POST /payments/charge\\\", \\\"POST /payments/refund\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"service_name\\\": \\\"notification-service\\\",\\n      \\\"language\\\": \\\"Node.js\\\",\\n      \\\"framework\\\": \\\"Express\\\",\\n      \\\"entry_point\\\": \\\"src/index.js\\\",\\n      \\\"exposed_endpoints\\\": [\\\"POST /notifications/email\\\", \\\"POST /notifications/push\\\"]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"database\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"TripPlannerPostgres\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"PostgreSQL\\\",\\n      \\\"host\\\": \\\"postgres-db.akka:5432\\\",\\n      \\\"roles\\\": [\\\"admin\\\", \\\"app_ro\\\", \\\"app_rw\\\"],\\n      \\\"tables\\\": Authorization to specific tables\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"TripPlannerRedis\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"Redis\\\",\\n      \\\"host\\\": \\\"redis-cache.akka:6379\\\",\\n      \\\"purpose\\\": \\\"Session store + recommendation cache\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"TripPlannerAnalytics\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"ClickHouse\\\",\\n      \\\"host KOYO60l\\\",\\n      \\\"purpose\\\": \\\"loy geo query analytics\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"TripPlannerDataLake\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"Sранспорт\\\",\\n      \\\"purpose\\\": \\\"Store raw logs, user actions, search queries for offline model retraining\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"apis\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"service\\\": \\\"auth-service\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\",\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"/auth/login\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User login via email/password, returns JWT and refresh token\\\",\\n      \\\"payload_example\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"john@example.com\\\",\\n        \\\"password\\\": \\\"SuP3rP@sS\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"response_example\\\": {\\n        \\\"accessToken\\\": \\\"<jwt>\\\",\\n        \\\"refreshToken\\\": \\\"<token>\\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"service\\\": \\\"user-service\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\",\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"/users/me\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Return current authenticated user profile\\\",\\n      \\\"authentication\\\": true\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"service\\\": \\\"itinerary-service\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\",\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"/itineraries\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Create new itinerary with suggested activities, locations and dates\\\",\\n      \\\"payload_example\\\": {\\n        \\\"title\\\": \\\"Paris Spring\\\",\\n        \\\"startDate\\\": \\\"2025-04-01 nazw\\\",\\n        \\\"endDate\\\": \\\"2025-04-07\\\",\\n        \\\"preferences\\\": {\\n          \\\"913\\\": \\\"museums\\\",\\n          \\\"hotels\\\": \\\"4-star\\\"\\n        }\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"service\\\": \\\"recommendation-service\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\",\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"/recommend\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\" Koree ge a ranking of 20 suggestions based on query and constraints\\\",\\n      \\\"payload_example\\\": {\\n        \\\"userId\\\": \\\"63724fcd\\\",\\n        \\\"query\\\": \\\"romantic weekend територія\\\",\\n        \\\"constraints\\\": {\\n          \\\"budget\\\": 2000,\\n          \\\"activities\\\": [\\\"culture\\\", \\\"food\\\"],\\n          \\\"dateRange\\\": \\\"2025-06-12 .. 2025-06-20\\\"\\n        }\\n      },\\n      \\\"response_example\\\": {\\n        \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"destination\\\": \\\"Barcelona\\\",\\n            \\\"score\\\": 0.87,\\n            \\\"details\\\": \\\"...\\\"\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"service\\\": \\\"payment-service\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\",\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"/payments/charge\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Charge a credit card for itinerary booking\\\",\\n      \\\"payload_example\\\": {\\n        \\\"billingId\\\": \\\"pay_001\\\",\\n        \\\"amount\\\": 1125.00,\\n        \\\"currency\\\": \\\"USD\\\",\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"Itinerary ID 123456\\\"\\n      }\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"folder_structure\\\": [\\n    \\\"root/\\\",\\n    \\\"  ├── README.md\\\",\\n    \\\"  ├── .env.example\\\",\\n    \\\"  ├── docs/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   ├── architecture.md\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   ├── api.md\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   └── deploy.md\\\",\\n    \\\"  ├── infra/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   ├── terraform/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   ├── main.tf\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   ├── variables.tf\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   └── outputs.tf\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   ├── helm/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   ├── auth-service/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   ├── user-service/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   └── recommendation-service/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   └── kustomize/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │       └── kustomization.yaml\\\",\\n    \\\"  ├── services/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   ├── auth-service/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   ├── src/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   │   ├── routes/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   │   ├── controllers/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   │   ├── models/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   │   └── server.js\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   ├── Dockerfile\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   └── package.json\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   ├── user-service/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   ├── src/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   │   └── app.js\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   ├── Dockerfile /**\\r\\n    …\\\",\\n    \\\"  ├── client/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   ├── src/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   ├── app/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   │   ├── hooks/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   │   ├── components/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   │   ├── pages/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   │   └── routes.tsx\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   ├── tailwind.config.js\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   ├── vite.config.js\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   │   └── tsconfig.json\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   ├── public/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   └── Dockerfile\\\",\\n    \\\"  ├── .github/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │   └── workflows/\\\",\\n    \\\"  │       ├── ci.yml\\\",\\n    \\\"  │       └── deploy.yml\\\",\\n    \\\"  └── .gitignore\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"deployment\\\": {\\n    \\\"cloud_provider\\\": \\\"AWS\\\",\\n    \\\"compute\\\": \\\"EKS (managed Kubernetes) for microservices, Lambda for small helper endpoints\\\",\\n    \\\"storage\\\": {\\n      \\\"rds\\\": \\\"PostgreSQL at reserved instance\\\",\\n      \\\"elasticache\\\": \\\"Redis cluster\\\",\\n      \\\"s3\\\": \\\"data-lake-bucket\\\",\\n      \\\"efs\\\": \\\"for shared media\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"networking\\\": {\\n Kampala: \\\"VPC with public and private subnets, NAT Gateways, ALB fronting the API gateway\\\",\\n      \\\"cnfiguration\\\": \\\"NGINX Ingress Controller, cert-manager for Let's Encrypt TLS\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"ci_cd\\\": \\\"GitHub Actions + Terraform + Helm + Docker Hub\\\",\\n    \\\"monitoring\\\": \\\"Prometheus + Grafana dashboards\\\",\\n    \\\"logging\\\": \\\"Loki + Fluentd\\\",\\n    \\\"autoscaling\\\": \\\"KEDA based on request rate & queue length\\\",\\n    \\\"security\\\": \\\"IAM roles, resource policies, secrets in AWS Secrets Manager, encryption at rest\\\",\\n    \\\"backup\\\": \\\"RDS automated backups, S3 versioning for lake, snapshot of EFS\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":2969,\"promptTokens\":132,\"totalTokens\":3101}}}"}}
