backend, frontend, ingress, and external secrets. Autoscaling set on CPU usage to handle traffic spikes from travel recommendations.\\\",\\n  \\\"cloud\\\": \\\"AWS with Route 53 for DNS, S3 for static assets, CloudFront for CDN, and RDS (PostgreSQL) for structured data. Optional: DynamoDB for caching flight/price information via API gateway.\\\",\\n  \\\"ci_cd\\\": \\\"GitHub Actions workflow:\\\\n- lint (ruff for Python, eslint for JS)\\\\n- unit tests (pytest, jest)\\\\n- build Docker images and push to Amazon ECR\\\\n- Helm chart lint + package\\\\n- Deploy to test namespace via `helm upgrade --install`\\\\n- Run integration tests\\\\n- On merge to main, automatically promote to prod namespace.\\\\n- Integrate canary deployments using Argo Rollouts or Flagger.\\\",\\n  \\\"monitoring\\\": \\\"Prometheus scraped from /metrics endpoints of both backend and frontend. Use Grafana dashboards for traffic, latency, error rates, and OpenTelemetry traces. Alerting via PagerDuty or Opsgenie for anomalies. Include Loki for log aggregation.\\\"\\n}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":693,\"promptTokens\":122,\"totalTokens\":815}}}"}}
