tion B (2 days), destination C (2 days).\\\",\\n        \\\"Set departure date and flight preferences.\\\",\\n        \\\"Generate itinerary.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_result\\\": \\\"Itinerary contains start/end dates, suggested activities per day, and transport links between cities.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"TC003\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Cost estimation accuracy\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Verify that the cost estimate matches the sum of individual components (flight, accommodation, activities).\\\",\\n      \\\"steps\\\": [\\n        \\\"Generate itinerary for a 5-day trip to Bali.\\\",\\n        \\\"Review cost breakdown.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_result\\\": \\\"Total estimated cost equals sum of flight price + accommodation total + activities total ± \\\\$5 for currency conversion fees.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"TC004\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"User profile update and sync\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Update user preferences and ensure next recommendation respects changes.\\\",\\n      \\\"steps\\\": [\\n        \\\"Change preference from beaches to mountains.\\\",\\n        \\\"Generate new recommendation.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_result\\\": \\\"New destinations prioritize mountainous regions.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"TC005\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"International travel restrictions check\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Input a destination that has COVID-19 restrictions and verify that the planner alerts the user.\\\",\\n      \\\"steps\\\": [\\n        \\\"Set destination to a country with travel restrictions.\\\",\\n        \\\"edes to create itinerary.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_result\\\": \\\"Alert displayed with entry requirements and potential quarantine periods.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"edge_cases\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"EC001\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Empty preference list\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User submits search with no preferences.\\\",\\n      \\\"result_expected\\\": \\\"System prompts user to input at least one preference.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"EC002\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Contradictory constraints\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User selects sea adventures but dates coincide with monsoon season for chosen destinations.\\\",\\n      \\\"result_expected\\\": \\\"Planner reschedules trips or suggests alternative destinations.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"EC003\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Invalid date range\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Start date after end date.\\\",\\n      \\\"result_expected\\\": \\\"Error message: \\\\\\\"End date must be after start date.\\\\\\\"\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"EC004\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Excessive budget budget\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User sets budget far above average for planned length of trip.\\\",\\n      \\\"result_expected\\\": \\\"Planner includes premium options but remains within soft budget limit with notification.\\\"\\n    },\\n    פס {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"EC005\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Unsupported language preference\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User selects language not supported by the UI.\\\",\\n      \\\"result_expected\\\": \\\"Fallback to English and display warning.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"integration_tests\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"IT001\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Flight booking API integration\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Confirm that flight options are fetched from third‑party API and that booking flow completes.\\\",\\n      \\\"steps\\\": [\\n        \\\"Select departure and destination airports.\\\",\\n        \\\"Request flight options.\\\",\\n        \\\"Book one itinerary.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_resultếng\\\": \\\"HTTP 200 received for each flight fetch; booking confirmation returned with booking ID.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"IT002\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Hotel reservation API integration\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Validate that hotel search returns accurate availability and booking works.\\\",\\n      \\\"steps\\\": [\\n        \\\"Search for hotels in destination for travel dates.\\\",\\n        \\\"Select hotel.\\\",\\n        \\\"Book stay.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_result\\\": \\\"Availability matches API response; booking confirmation contains room details.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"IT003\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Payment gateway integration\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Verify that payment is processed securely and transactional events are recorded.\\\",\\n      \\\"steps\\\": [\\n        \\\"Proceed to checkout with itinerary.\\\",\\n        \\\"Enter payment details.\\\",\\n        \\\"Submit.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_result\\\": \\\"Payment gateway returns success; order status updated to \\\\\\\"paid\\\\\\\".\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"IT004\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Map service integration\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Travel route suggestions use mapping API for distance/time calculations.\\\",\\n      \\\"steps\\\": [\\n        \\\"Request route between two landmarks.\\\",\\n        \\\"Generate itinerary swim.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_result\\\": \\\"Map API returns leg details, travel time, and estimated distances used in itinerary.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"performance_tests\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"PT001\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Response time for destination recommendation\\\",\\n      \\\"criteria\\\": \\\"Max 2 seconds for 90th percentile under 100 concurrent requests.\\\",\\n      \\\"tool\\\": \\\"JMeter\\\",\\n      \\\"expected_result\\\": \\\"All response times ≤ 2s for 90th percentile.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"PT002\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Scalability of itinerary generation\\\",\\n      \\\"criteria\\\": \\\"Can handle 500 concurrent itinerary creations without degradation.\\\",\\n      \\\"tool\\\": \\\"Locust\\\",\\n      \\\"expected_result\\\": \\\"CPU < 75%, memory < 2GB per node, response time < 3s.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"PT003\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Database query performance\\\",\\n      \\\"criteria\\\": \\\"Top 10 queries must complete < 100ms under load of 2000 users.\\\",\\n      \\\"tool\\\": \\\"db<>fiddle and profiling\\\",\\n      \\\"expected_result\\\": \\\"All queries within threshold.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"PT004\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Long‑running API stability\\\",\\n      \\\"criteria\\\": \\\"Flight booking API should remain stable over 24‑hour continuous load.\\\",\\n      \\\"tool\\\": \\\"k6\\\",\\n      \\\"expected_result\\\": \\\"No crashes, error rate < 0.1%.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":1724,\"promptTokens\":122,\"totalTokens\":1846}}}"}}
