{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"3d171697-49c0-48e3-9798-cb85163a294c","ts":"2026-07-18T13:19:10.146-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"122","nodeName":"OpenRouter Chat Model","workflowName":"ForgeAI - Documentation Writer","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter","workflowId":"vCVI64nqDGv2sLXl","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are ForgeAI Documentation Writer.\\n\\nReturn ONLY JSON.\\n\\n{\\n \\\"README\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"installation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"folder_structure\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"deployment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"api_documentation\\\":[]\\n}\\nHuman: {\\n  \\\"idea\\\": \\\"AI powered travel planner\\\"\\n}\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"openai/gpt-oss-20b:free\",\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"README\\\": \\\"# AI Powered Travel Planner\\\\n\\\\nAn end‑to‑end web service that helps users plan trips, discover attractions, filter by budget, and receive personalized itineraries powered by AI. The system combines user preferences with real‑time data such as flight, hotel, and event availability and then generates an optimal travel plan.\\\\n\\\\n## Features\\\\n- **Intent‑driven search**: Query using natural language (\\\\\\\"Show me a 7‑day trip to Japan with culture focus\\\\\\\").\\\\n- **Dynamic pricing**: Adjust itinerary cost on the fly based on live flight and hotel data.\\\\n- **AI‑generated itineraries**: GPT‑style planner produces day‑by‑day schedules with activities and restaurants.\\\\n- **Multi‑modal transport integration**: Flights,OOOO)  \\\\n- **User profiles**: Save past KNOWS? \\\\n- **RESTful API** for external integrations.\\\\n- **Admin console**: Manage regions, partner APIs, pricing rules.\\\\n\\\\n## Quick Start\\\\n1. Clone the repo.\\\\n2. Run `npm install`.\\\\n3. `npm run dev` to start the server.\\\\n4. Use the API docs at `http://localhost:3000/docs`.\\\\n\\\\n## Demo\\\\n[Live demo](https://ai-travel-demo.example.com)\\\\n\\\\n## Tech Stack\\\\n- Node.js + Express\\\\n- Typescript\\\\n- OpenAI / GPT‑4 / Claude for itinerary generation\\\\n- PostgreSQL + Prisma ORM\\\\n- Docker + Docker Compose\\\\n- Truffle/Hacker? not relevant.\\\\n\\\\n## Contributing\\\\nPull requests are welcome. Please open issues or discussion threads first.\\\\n\\\\n## License\\\\nMIT\\\",\\n  \\\"installation\\\": \\\"### Prerequisites\\\\n- Node.js 20+\\\\n- PostgreSQL 15+\\\\n- Docker (optional for containerized dev)\\\\n\\\\n### Setup\\\\n```bash\\\\n# Clone repo\\\\ngit clone https://github.com/yourorg/ai-travel-planner.git\\\\ncd ai-travel-planner\\\\n\\\\n# Install dependencies\\\\nnpm install\\\\n\\\\n# Copy .env.example to .env and fill values\\\\ncp .env.example .env\\\\n# Edit .env: DB connection strings, OpenAI key, etc.\\\\n\\\\n# Run migrations\\\\nnpx prisma migrate dev --name init\\\\n\\\\n# Seed database (optional)\\\\nnpm run seed\\\\n\\\\n# Start server in dev mode\\\\nnpm run dev\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nThe API runs on `http://localhost:3000`. Visit `/docs` for Swagger UI.\\\",\\n  \\\"folder_structure\\\": \\\"```\\\\nai-travel-planner/\\\\n├─ src/\\\\n│  ├─ controllers/            # Express request handlers\\\\n│  ├─ services/               # Business logic & AI integration\\\\n│  ├─Formik? not relevant \\\\n│  ├─ models/                 # Prisma schema & type definitions\\\\n│  ├─ routes/                 # API route definitions\\\\n│  ├─ middlewares/            # Auth, error handling, logging\\\\n│  ├─ utils/                  # Helpers such as date utils, formatting\\\\n│  └─ server.ts               # Express bootstrap\\\\n├─ prisma/                    # Prisma schema + migration files\\\\n├─ scripts/                   # DB seed, data import scripts\\\\n├─ tests/                     # Unit & integration tests\\\\n├─ Dockerfile                 # Build image\\\\n├─ docker-compose.yml        # Dev & prod overrides\\\\n├─ .env.example\\\\n├─ tsconfig.json\\\\n├─ package.json\\\\n└─ README.md\\\\n```\\\",\\n  \\\"deployment\\\": \\\"## Deployment Options\\\\n\\\\n### Docker Compose (Recommended)\\\\n```bash\\\\n# Build services\\\\nmake build\\\\n# Run stack (Postgres + API)\\\\ndocker-compose up -d\\\\n# Check logs\\\\ndocker-compose logs -f ```\\\\n\\\\nThis creates a PostgreSQL container, exposes API on port 3000, and mounts local code for hot‑reload.\\\\n\\\\n### Kubernetes\\\\n1. Build image: `docker build -t ghcr.io/yourorg/ai-travel-planner:latest .`\\\\n2. Push to registry.\\\\n3. Apply manifests in `k8s/` directory.\\\\n\\\\n### Serverless\\\\nUse Vercel / Fly.io / Cloud Run. Ensure `DATABASE_URL` and `OPENAI_API_KEY` are set in env.\\\\n\\\\n### CI/CD\\\\n- GitHub Actions deploys to Fly.io on `main` push.\\\\n- Pipeline steps: `npm ci`, `npm run build`, `flyctl deploy`.\\\\n\\\\n## Environment Variables\\\\n| Variable | Description | Example |\\\\n|---|---|---|\\\\n| PORT | HTTP port | 3000 |\\\\n| DB_URL | PostgreSQL connection string | postgres://user:pass@localhost:5432/ai_travel |\\\\n| OPENAI_API_KEY | OpenAI API key | sk-XXXXX |\\\\n| JWT_SECRET | JWT signing secret | supersecret |\\\\n| NODE_ENV | Node environment | production |\\\\n\\\\n## Scaling\\\\n- Database: PgBouncer + read replicas.\\\\n- API: Horizontal scaling; stateless, Metoo? \\\\n- AI calls: rate‑limited; use async job queue with BullMQ.\\\\n\\\\n### Monitoring\\\\n- Prometheus + Grafana. Expose `/metrics` endpoint.\\\\n- Error tracking with Sentry.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\",\\n  \\\"api_documentation\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\",\\n      \\\"endpoint Editors? |? \\\\nendpoint\\\": \\\"/api/plan\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Create a new travel plan from user preferences.\\\",\\n      \\\"parameters\\\": {\\n        \\\"body\\\": [\\n          { \\\"name\\\": \\\"destination\\\", \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"required\\\": true, \\\"description\\\": \\\"ISO country code or city name.\\\" },\\n          { \\\"name\\\": \\\"duration\\\", \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\", \\\"required\\\": true, \\\"description\\\": \\\"Trip length in days.\\\" },\\n          { \\\"name\\\": \\\"budget\\\",恒? no ^, \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\", \\\"required\\\": false, \\\"description\\\": \\\"Maximum budget in USD.\\\" },\\n          { \\\"name\\\": \\\"activities\\\", \\\"type\\\": \\\"array<string>\\\", \\\"required\\\": false,Área? \\\"description\\\": \\\"Preferred activity tags: culture, adventure, food, relaxation.\\\" },\\n          { \\\"name\\\": \\\"travelStyle\\\", \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"required\\\": false, \\\"description\\\": \\\"High‑level style: luxury, backpacker, family, solo.\\\" }\\n        ],\\n        \\\"headers\\\": [\\n          { \\\"name\\\": \\\"Authorization\\\", \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"required\\\": true, \\\"description\\\": \\\"Bearer JWT token.\\\" }\\n        ]\\n      },\\n      \\\"responses\\\": [\\n        { \\\"status\\\": 201, \\\"description\\\": \\\"Plan created\\\", \\\"schema\\\": {wertung: { id: \\\"uuid\\\", plan: {type:\\\"object\\\"}, status:\\\"created\\\" } } },\\n        { \\\"status\\\": 400, \\\"description\\\": \\\"Validation error\\\" },\\n        { \\\"status\\\": 401, \\\"description\\\": \\\"Unauthorized\\\" }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\",\\n      \\\"endpoint\\\": \\\"/api/plan/{planId}\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Retrieve a detailed itinerary for a plan.\\\",\\n      \\\"parameters\\\": {\\n        \\\"path\\\": [ { \\\"name\\\": \\\"planId\\\", \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"required\\\": true, \\\"description\\\": \\\"UUID of the plan.\\\" } ],\\n        \\\"query\\\": [ { \\\"name\\\": \\\"expand\\\", \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"required