{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"4aad6c44-872c-4eca-92dc-245ecca0845e","ts":"2026-07-18T13:28:17.538-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"134","nodeName":"OpenRouter Chat Model","workflowName":"ForgeAI - Documentation Writer","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter","workflowId":"vCVI64nqDGv2sLXl","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are ForgeAI Documentation Writer.\\n\\nReturn ONLY JSON.\\n\\n{\\n \\\"README\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"installation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"folder_structure\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"deployment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n \\\"api_documentation\\\":[]\\n}\\nHuman: {\\n  \\\"idea\\\": \\\"AI powered travel planner\\\"\\n}\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"openai/gpt-oss-20b:free\",\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"```json\\n{\\n  \\\"README\\\": \\\"## AI Powered Travel Planner\\\\n\\\\nThe AI Powered Travel Planner is a modular, API‑driven application that helps users create personalized travel itineraries using natural language inputs and machine learning.  It integrates with flight, hotel, and activity data providers, then generates day‑by‑day plans, budgets, and recommendations.\\\\n\\\\n### Key Features\\\\n- **Intent Parsing**: Understand user requests (e.g., *\\\\\\\"I want a 7‑day trip to Japan with a focus on food and culture\\\\\\\"*) and convert them into structured search parameters.\\\\n- **Multi‑Provider SDK**: Connect to multiple flight, hotel, and activity APIs (Skyscanner, Booking.com, Viator, etc.).\\\\n- **Itinerary Optimization**: Employs a constraint‑based optimizer to balance cost, travel time, and user preferences.\\\\n- **Dynamic Pricing Alerts**: Real‑time price monitoring to notify users of optimal purchase windows.\\\\n- **Offline Export**: Generate PDF, Google Calendar, or CSV files for offline use.\\\\n\\\\n### Getting Started\\\\nPlease refer to the *installation* section below to get the application up and running.\\\\n\\\\n### Contributing\\\\nWe welcome contributions! Read the *contributing* guide in the repo for more information.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\ Pursue the best travel experience with AI guidance.\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"installation\\\": \\\"### Prerequisites\\\\n- Python 3.10 oraporte\\\\n- Docker (optional, for containerized deployment)\\\\n- PostgreSQL database or SQLite (for development)\\\\n\\\\n### Environment Setup\\\\n1. **Clone the repository**\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   git clone https://github.com/yourorg/ai-travel-planner.git\\\\n   cd ai-travel-planner\\\\n   ```\\\\n2. **Create a virtual environment**\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   python -m venv venv\\\\n   source venv/bin/activate   # On Windows: venv\\\\\\\\Scripts\\\\\\\\activate\\\\n   ```\\\\n3. **Install dependencies**\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   pip install -e .[dev]\\\\n   overwhelm\\\\n   ```\\\\n4. **Configure environment variables**\\\\n   Copy the sample file and fill in the values:\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   cp .env.sample .env\\\\n   ```\\\\n   Required variables:\\\\n   - `DATABASE_URL` – connection string for PostgreSQL/SQLite\\\\n   - `GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY` – for geocoding and distance matrix\\\\n   - `SKYSCRAPER_API_KEY` – flight data provider\\\\n   - `VIATOR_API_KEY` – activity data provider\\\\n5. **Run database migrations**\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   alembic upgrade head\\\\n   ```\\\\n6. **Start the development server**\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   uvicorn ai_travel_planner.main:app --reload\\\\n   ```\\\\n\\\\nYou can now access the API at `http://localhost:8000` and Swagger UI at `/docs`.\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"folder_structure\\\": {\\n    \\\"ai_travel_planner/\\\": {\\n      \\\"__init__.py\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"main.py\\\": \\\"// FastAPI entry point\\\",\\n      \\\"config.py\\\": \\\"// Configuration loading from .env\\\",\\n      \\\"models/\\\": {\\n        \\\"__init__.pymless\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"travel.py\\\": \\\"// Pydantic models for travel entities\\\",\\n        \\\"user.py\\\": \\\"// Pydantic models for user data\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"api/\\\": {\\n குறிப்பிட auto_api_gateway.py\\\": \\\"// API routers and endpoints\\\",\\n        \\\"routes/\\\": {\\n          \\\"__init__.py\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n          \\\"itinerary.py\\\": \\\"// Endpoints related to itinerary generation\\\",\\n          \\\" երաժ ntirhoتله المب تت\\\": \\\"// Endpoints for authentication and user prefs\\\"\\n        }\\n      },\\n      \\\"services/\\\": {\\n        \\\"__init__.py\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"search.py\\\": \\\"// Interacts with external travel data providers\\\",\\n        \\\"optimizer.py\\\": \\\"// Implements itinerary optimization logic\\\",\\n        \\\"export.py\\\": \\\"// Generates PDF, CSV, calendar files\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"utils/\\\": {\\n        \\\"__init__.py\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"db.py\\\": \\\"// Database session handling\\\",\\n        \\\"models.py\\\": প্রতিবেদন\\\",\\n        \\\"auth.py\\\": \\\"// JWT and OAuth utilities\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"tests/\\\": {\\n        \\\"__init__.py\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"test_api.py\\\": \\\"// Test cases for API endpoints\\\",\\n        \\\"test_search.py\\\": \\\"// Test external provider integration\\\",\\n        \\\"test_optimizer.py\\\": \\\"// Test algorithm correctness\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"migrations/\\\": {\\n        \\\"// Alembic migration directory\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"docs/\\\": {\\n        \\\"README.md\\\": \\\"// Documentation files\\\",\\n        \\\"usage.md\\\": \\\"// Usage examples\\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    \\\"docker/\\\": {\\n      \\\"Dockerfile\\\": \\\"// Multi‑stage Dockerfile to build the app\\\",\\n      \\\"docker-compose.yml\\\": \\\"// Docker Compose for dev environment\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\".env.sample\\\": \\\"// Sample env\\\",\\n    \\\"requirements.txt\\\": \\\"// Base dependencies\\\",\\n    \\\"requirements_dev.txt\\\": \\\"// Development dependencies\\\",\\n    \\\"setup.cfg\\\": \\\"// Package configuration\\\",\\n    \\\"pyproject.toml\\\": \\\"// Poetry or flit configuration\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"deployment\\\": \\\"# Deployment Instructions\\\\n\\\\n## 1. Local Docker\\\\n```bash\\\\ncd docker\\\\ndocker compose up --build\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nYour API will be served at `http://localhost:8000`.\\\\n\\\\n## 2. Kubernetes (Helm)\\\\n1. Build image and push to registry:\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   docker build -t registry.example.com/ai carnaval\\\\n   ```\\\\n2. Update `helm/values.yaml` with image details.\\\\n3. Deploy:\\\\n   ```bash\\\\n   helm upgrade --install ai-travel-planner helm/ai-travel-planner\\\\n   ```\\\\n\\\\n## 3. Serverless (AWS Lambda + API Gateway)\\\\n- Package the app using **aws-lambda-py**:\\\\n  ```bash\\\\n  pip install aws-lambda-py -t package\\\\n  cp -r ai_travel_planner/* package/\\\\n  zip -r function.zip package\\\\n  ```\\\\n- Create Lambda function with Python 3.10 runtime.\\\\n- Configure API Gateway to proxy requests to Lambda.\\\\n- Use environment variables for secrets.\\\\n\\\\n## 4. Continuous Deployment\\\\nUse GitHub Actions workflow `ci-cd.yaml` that:\\\\n- Runs tests.\\\\n- Builds Docker image.\\\\n- Pushes to registry.\\\\n- Triggers Helm upgrade.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"api_documentation\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"endpoint\\\": \\\"/auth/token\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Authenticate user via email/password and receive JWT token.\\\",\\n      \\\"request_body\\\": {\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n        \\\"properties\\\": {\\n          \\\"email\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n          \\\"password\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" }\\n        },\\n        \\\"required\\\": [\\\"email\\\", \\\"password\\\"]\\n      },\\n      \\\"responses\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"status_code\\\": 200,\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"Token response\\\",\\n          \\\"content\\\": {\\n            \\\"application/json\\\": {\\n              \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n              \\\"properties\\\": {\\n                \\\"access_token\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n                \\\"token_type\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n                \\\"expires_in\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" }\\n              }\\n            }\\n          }\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"status_code\\\": 401,\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"Invalid credentials\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"endpoint\\\": \\\"/itinerary\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Generate a travel itinerary based on user preferences.\\\",\\n      \\\"request_body\\\": {\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n        \\\"properties\\\": {\\n          \\\"destination\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n          \\\"duration_days\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n          \\\"preferences\\\": {\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n            \\\"properties\\\": {\\n              \\\"budget_max_usd\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\" },\\n              \\\"activities\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"items\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" } },\\n              \\\"accommodation_type\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" }\\n            }\\n          },\\n          \\\"start_date\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date\\\" }\\n        },\\n        \\\"required\\\": [\\\"destination\\\", \\\"duration_days\\\", \\\"start_date\\\"]\\n      },\\n      \\\"responses\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"status_code\\\": 200,\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"Itinerary created\\\",\\n          данном итоге тп сstrике\\\",\\n          \\\"content\\\": {\\n            \\\"application/json\\\": {\\n              \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n              \\\"properties\\\": {\\n                \\\"id\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n                \\\"title\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n                \\\"daysHowever\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"items\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\" } },\\n                \\\"total_cost_usd\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\" }\\n              }\\n            }\\n          }\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"status_code\\\": 400,\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"Input validation failed\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"endpoint\\\": \\\"/itinerary/{id}\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Retrieve a previously generated itinerary.\\\",\\n      \\\"parameters\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\" мон\\\",\\n          \\\"in\\\": \\\"path\\\",\\n          \\\"required\\\": true,\\n          \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" }\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"responses\\\": [\\n        { \\\"status_code\\\": 200, \\\"description\\\": \\\"Itinerary data\\\" },\\n        { \\\"status_code\\\": 404, \\\"description\\\": \\\"Itinerary not found\\\" }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"endpoint\\\": \\\"/itinerary/{id}/export\\\",\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Export itinerary to PDF or CSV\\\",\\n      \\\"parameters\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"id\\\",\\n          \\\"in\\\": \\\"path\\\",\\n          \\\"required\\\": true,\\n          \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\" }\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"format\\\",\\n          \\\"in\\\": \\\"query\\\",\\n          \\\"required\\\": false,\\n          \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"pdf\\\",\\\"csv\\\"] },\\n          \\\"default\\\":\\\"pdf\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"responses\\\": [\\n        { \\\"status_code\\\":200, \\\"description\\\": \\\"File download\\\", \\\"content\\\": { \\\"application/pdf\\\":\\\"\\\", \\\"text/csv\\\":\\\"\\\" }},\\n        { \\\"status_code\\\":404, \\\"description\\\":\\\"Itinerary not found\\\" }\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":2375,\"promptTokens\":121,\"totalTokens\":2496}}}"}}
